## Performance Targets

| Metric | Target | Status |
|--------|--------|--------|
| Hot Query Latency | < 1.1ms | ✅ Claimed in README |
| Throughput | ~900 qps | ✅ Claimed in README |
| Concurrent p99 | < 20ms | 🎯 Target (Rust kernel) |
| Cold → Hot Speedup | > 10x | ✅ Tested in [test_first_light.py](file:///Users/affantanke/Developer/ResonantMemoryMesh/tests/test_first_light.py) |
| L1 Cache Cap | 1M nodes | ✅ V-LRU eviction implemented |

