## What's NOT Yet Done / Gaps

1. **Broken imports in 2 test files** — [test_acceptance.py](file:///Users/affantanke/Developer/ResonantMemoryMesh/tests/test_acceptance.py) and [test_synthesizer.py](file:///Users/affantanke/Developer/ResonantMemoryMesh/tests/test_synthesizer.py) use `from src.*` imports (old structure) instead of `from rmm.*`
2. **Sleep Cycle** — `archived_nodes` table exists in SQL but no Python code implements the archival/revival flow
3. **HNSW index** — commented out in schema.sql, only IVFFlat is active
4. **No CI/CD** — no GitHub Actions, Makefile, or test runner config
5. **No benchmarking harness** — performance claims exist but no automated benchmark suite
6. **Metadata in PostgresStorage** — [_row_to_node()](file:///Users/affantanke/Developer/ResonantMemoryMesh/rmm-core/rmm/adapters/postgres.py#203-218) doesn't load metadata from the DB row
7. **Duplicate passive warming call** — [mesh.py](file:///Users/affantanke/Developer/ResonantMemoryMesh/rmm-core/rmm/mesh.py) lines 177-181 call [_update_rust_l1()](file:///Users/affantanke/Developer/ResonantMemoryMesh/rmm-core/rmm/mesh.py#82-104) twice in succession
8. **No real embedding model integration** — all tests use random vectors; no adapter for actual embedding providers
